<title>POLAND: KGHM GDR OFFER OVERSUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>KGHM GDR OFFER OVERSUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:	   KGHM Polska Miedz SA copper firm</p>
<p>Type of Issue: global depository receipts (two shares per GDR)</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Offered:	     35,000,000</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Subscribed:	 166,951,902</p>
<p> Price (PLN)	 $12.87 per GDR</p>
<p>NOTE: KGHM said in a statement 379 orders were placed for its</p>
<p>GDRs, which were allocated to 253 investors.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
